        "kind": "design choice",
        "basis": "Design choice informed by DOPPS (Moist et al. 2008, Clin J Am Soc Nephrol): longer travel time to dialysis went with worse quality of life, adherence and survival. Dialysis is repeated two or three times a week, so the window is short. The 60 minutes is ours."
      },
